      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "BPF Ring Buffer",
      "source_hash": 11314169273060499099,
      "context_hash": 4628886762169397548,
      "translation": "BPF 링 버퍼",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF",
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Lock-free, memory-efficient event streaming from BPF programs",
      "source_hash": 1578086823727621191,
      "context_hash": 11473282135559830031,
      "translation": "BPF 프로그램에서의 lock-free, 메모리 효율적 이벤트 스트리밍",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF program": "BPF 프로그램"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Why not perf event output?",
      "source_hash": 10569488309852822472,
      "context_hash": 624975200118600764,
      "translation": "perf event output을 쓰지 않는 이유",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "perf": "perf"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Before `BPF_MAP_TYPE_RINGBUF` (5.8), BPF programs streamed events to userspace via `bpf_perf_event_output`:",
      "source_hash": 3979806668970940121,
      "context_hash": 151473437626424742,
      "translation": "`BPF_MAP_TYPE_RINGBUF`(5.8) 이전에는 BPF 프로그램이 `bpf_perf_event_output`를 통해 사용자 공간으로 이벤트를 스트리밍했습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF program": "BPF 프로그램",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Problems with `PERF_EVENT_ARRAY`:",
      "source_hash": 320059576577079221,
      "context_hash": 12995803773096276788,
      "translation": "`PERF_EVENT_ARRAY`의 문제점:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Per-CPU**: separate buffer per CPU, requires per-CPU polling in userspace",
      "source_hash": 9340004015685485711,
      "context_hash": 3529289559843956458,
      "translation": "**Per-CPU**: CPU마다 별도의 버퍼를 사용하므로 사용자 공간에서 CPU별 폴링이 필요합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Memory waste**: each CPU gets a full buffer even if mostly idle",
      "source_hash": 14157200300498787474,
      "context_hash": 1153183859626836988,
      "translation": "**메모리 낭비**: 대부분 유휴 상태인 CPU에도 전체 크기의 버퍼가 할당됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**No variable-size records**: must pre-declare event size",
      "source_hash": 5161758336361977279,
      "context_hash": 13648411225216709209,
      "translation": "**가변 크기 레코드 미지원**: 이벤트 크기를 미리 선언해야 합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "**Wakeup overhead**: `epoll_wait` requires a fd per CPU",
      "source_hash": 653677282184654119,
      "context_hash": 2161692313413226271,
      "translation": "**wakeup 오버헤드**: `epoll_wait`에 CPU마다 fd가 하나씩 필요합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "overhead": "오버헤드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "BPF ring buffer design",
      "source_hash": 6728750173916005413,
      "context_hash": 13433038006330665517,
      "translation": "BPF 링 버퍼 설계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF",
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`BPF_MAP_TYPE_RINGBUF` uses a **single shared ring buffer** across all CPUs with a lock-free design:",
      "source_hash": 1187761904867458170,
      "context_hash": 18115529434575898214,
      "translation": "`BPF_MAP_TYPE_RINGBUF`는 lock-free 설계로 모든 CPU가 **하나의 공유 링 버퍼**를 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Key properties:",
      "source_hash": 5409981686824485612,
      "context_hash": 12020560913046075105,
      "translation": "주요 특성:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Single buffer**: no per-CPU waste; all CPUs share one ring",
      "source_hash": 11565092154200257857,
      "context_hash": 8817135586255167998,
      "translation": "**단일 버퍼**: CPU별 낭비가 없으며 모든 CPU가 하나의 링을 공유합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "CPUs": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762855Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Spinlock-free**: compare-and-swap for producer position reservation",
      "source_hash": 1331070658740802191,
      "context_hash": 7285912830460315694,
      "translation": "**스핀락 없음**: 생산자 위치 예약에 compare-and-swap 사용",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "producer": "생산자",
        "spinlock": "스핀락"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:26:44.805350Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**Two-phase commit**: reserve space, fill it, then submit or discard",
      "source_hash": 11164535076368046511,
      "context_hash": 13190178146521797904,
      "translation": "**2단계 커밋**: 공간을 예약하고 채운 뒤 submit하거나 discard합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762855Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "**Memory-mapped**: userspace reads directly without syscall",
      "source_hash": 12166317020397302423,
      "context_hash": 11238590139313375646,
      "translation": "**메모리 매핑**: 사용자 공간이 시스템 콜 없이 직접 읽습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762855Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "BPF program side",
      "source_hash": 3458223609285750600,
      "context_hash": 11796606809281910740,
      "translation": "BPF 프로그램 측",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF program": "BPF 프로그램"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762855Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "bpf_ringbuf_output: one-shot alternative",
      "source_hash": 15570335025635520054,
      "context_hash": 13609054824887667500,
      "translation": "bpf_ringbuf_output: 일회성 대안",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762855Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For small, fixed-size events where reserve+submit is overkill:",
      "source_hash": 12212813308695866690,
      "context_hash": 10550911665972005599,
      "translation": "reserve+submit이 과한 작은 고정 크기 이벤트의 경우:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762855Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Discard on error",
      "source_hash": 16702535681585699825,
      "context_hash": 8180585459301062960,
      "translation": "오류 시 discard",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762855Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Userspace consumption with libbpf",
      "source_hash": 10444427291400415866,
      "context_hash": 11480079401674030250,
      "translation": "libbpf를 이용한 사용자 공간 소비",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762856Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Manual mmap polling",
      "source_hash": 4501714810781212132,
      "context_hash": 9096647789055616055,
      "translation": "수동 mmap 폴링",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762856Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Without libbpf, the ring buffer is accessed via `mmap`:",
      "source_hash": 15838582605389680514,
      "context_hash": 2335795048639927351,
      "translation": "libbpf 없이는 `mmap`을 통해 링 버퍼에 접근합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:22.762856Z",
      "issues": []
    },
